# Agent regression memory

## Before editing (mandatory for these areas)

Read **`docs/AGENT_REGRESSION_MEMORY.md`** (grep by file name or area) when changing:

- `PreviewEngineScreen.kt`, `RawCaptureSupport.kt`, session create / stream config
- `Dng12Saver.kt`, `StillCaptureMetadata.kt`, `LeafDngHalReconcile.kt`, DNG TIFF patches
- `LutCameraPreviewRenderer.kt`, `PreviewMainViewport`, GLES preview / resume
- `fleet/*`, `FleetCameraProfileBuilder.kt`, focal routing, capability gates
- Chrome layout locked in **`preview-chrome-ui-lock.mdc`** (behavioral only)

Also check **`docs/REVERTED_FEATURES_RESTORE_LIST.md`** §8 and the relevant **`.cursor/rules/*-lock.mdc`**.

## After a USB-proven fix or reverted attempt

Append one **`REG-YYYYMMDD-NNN`** row to **`docs/AGENT_REGRESSION_MEMORY.md`** in the **same commit** as the code change:

- **Do not** — what must not return without fresh proof
- **Proves OK** — script name and/or log tag (`PNS.CaptureStill`, `PNS.FleetMatrix`, …)
- **Also test** — cross-subsystem gates (e.g. capture change → pipeline verify **and** chrome gate if readout touched)

## Primary fleet device

Default USB proof: **CPH2583** (OnePlus 12). **CPH2655** only for optional OP13 regression — see **`AGENTS.md`** CRITICAL — Fleet.

## Do not

- Delete ledger rows (supersede instead).
- Close a BUILD_PLAN sprint without updating the ledger when the fix was regression-driven.
- Run **`pns_chrome_ux_gate`** and **`pns_photo_capture_verify`** in parallel on one device.
